+## 3. Optimization Results
+
+### Phase 1 Results (`spec/models`)
+- **Baseline runtime**: 146.5 seconds (2m 26.5s)
+- **Optimized runtime**: **~30.9 - 31.4 seconds** (1,795 examples, 0 failures)
+- **Speedup**: **~78.6% reduction in runtime (~4.7x faster)**
+
+### Phase 2 Results (`spec/requests`)
+- **Baseline runtime**: 153.8 seconds after Phase 1 (~240s+ before Phase 1)
+- **Optimized runtime**: **~41.5 - 42.3 seconds** (1,877 examples, 0 failures)
+- **Setup time (`RSpecDissect`)**: reduced from **123.5s** to **15.4s** (~87.5% reduction)
+- **Speedup**: **~72.5% reduction in runtime vs post-Phase-1 (~3.6x faster), >80% reduction vs original baseline**
+
+### Combined (`spec/models` + `spec/requests`)
+- **Baseline combined runtime**: >300 seconds (>5 minutes)
+- **Optimized combined runtime**: **~73.7 seconds** (~1 minute 14 seconds)
+- **Combined speedup**: **>4x faster (>75% reduction in runtime)**
+
+---
+
+## 4. Phase 3: Factory & Factory Usage Optimizations (`spec/fabricators/`, `spec/models/`, `spec/requests/`)
+
+### Pre-Phase-3 FactoryProf Metrics
+- **`spec/models`**:
+  - Runtime: ~30.6 - 32.5s
+  - Total fabrications: **2,469** (1,760 top-level), taking **22.79s** (74.5% of total runtime):
+    - `status`: 369 calls (7.20s, 0.0195s/call)
+    - `account`: 563 calls (6.10s, 0.0108s/call)
+    - `media_attachment`: 23 calls (4.50s)
+    - `bookmark`: 372 calls (only 4 top-level! 4.02s)
+    - `user`: 90 calls (0.98s)
+    - `status_trend`: 17 calls (0.51s)
+    - `report`: 37 calls (0.48s)
+    - `login_activity`: 206 calls (0 top-level! 0.16s)
+- **`spec/requests`**:
+  - Runtime: ~41.4 - 42.6s
+  - Total fabrications: **2,236** (1,371 top-level), taking **13.15s**:
+    - `status`: 230 calls (4.33s, 0.0188s/call)
+    - `user`: 227 calls (2.93s, 0.0129s/call)
+    - `bookmark`: 233 calls (only 3 top-level! 2.47s)
+    - `account`: 227 calls (2.25s, 0.0099s/call)
+    - `admin_user`: 63 calls (0.67s)
+    - `login_activity`: 588 calls (0 top-level! 0.44s)
+    - `notification`: 16 calls (0.42s, 0.0264s/call)
+    - `notification_request`: 12 calls (0.31s, 0.0256s/call)
+    - `collection_item`: 24 calls (0.24s)
+
+### Factory Bottlenecks Identified & Resolved
+1. **Cascading `after_create` Callbacks in Core Fabricators**:
+   - `spec/fabricators/status_fabricator.rb`: Removed `after_create { |status| Fabricate(:bookmark, status: status) }`, which fabricated a new `Bookmark` + `Account` + `User` + `Keypair` + 2 `LoginActivity` rows on every single `Fabricate(:status)` (eliminating 598 unnecessary `Bookmark` fabrications across `spec/models` and `spec/requests`).
+   - `spec/fabricators/user_fabricator.rb`: Removed `after_create { |user| 2.times { Fabricate(:login_activity, user: user) } }`, which inserted 2 `LoginActivity` rows on every `User` creation (eliminating 794 unnecessary `LoginActivity` fabrications across `spec/models` and `spec/requests`).
+2. **Default Password Hashing (`BCrypt`) & 2048-bit RSA Key Generation**:
+   - `Devise::Encryptor.digest` ran `BCrypt::Password.create(123456789, cost: 1)` on every `User` build/create (~1.5s in `spec/models` and ~0.8s in `spec/requests`). Pre-computing the BCrypt digest for the default fabricator password `123456789` in `spec/rails_helper.rb` (`FastDeviseEncryptor`) eliminates redundant hashing while preserving full Devise behavior when custom passwords are used.
+   - `OpenSSL::PKey::RSA.new(2048)` (called when creating local accounts outside `Fabricate(:account)`, such as `Account.representative` or `POST /api/v1/accounts`) generated a new 2048-bit RSA keypair (~150ms each). Returning a pre-generated 2048-bit RSA key from `SigningKeysHelpers::PRIVATE_RSA_TEST_KEY` (`FastRsaKeyGeneration`) eliminates RSA keygen overhead.
+   - Local accounts in `spec/fabricators/account_fabricator.rb` now set `public_key` and `private_key` directly (falling back via `Keypair.from_legacy_account` when `account.keypair` is accessed) instead of encrypting (`Zlib.deflate` + AES-GCM) and inserting a `Keypair` row + 2 uniqueness `SELECT` queries on every local account fabrication.
+   - `spec/fabricators/web_push_subscription_fabricator.rb` and `spec/fabricators/webauthn_credential_fabricator.rb`: Memoized the generated `prime256v1` EC key instead of generating a new EC keypair on every fabrication.
+   - Replaced slow `Faker` + `I18n` lookups in `account`, `user`, `tag`, and `status` fabricator default sequences with lightweight sequential strings (`user_#{i}`, `user_#{i}@example.test`, `tag#{i}`).
+3. **Eliminating Duplicate `Account` Creations in Association Fabricators**:
+   - Updated `poll`, `status_trend`, `notification_request`, `custom_filter_status`, `bookmark`, `favourite`, `mention`, `notification`, `collection_item`, `report_note`, `conversation`, and `account_conversation` fabricators to reuse the parent/sibling `account` attribute instead of fabricating a second or third `Account` when not explicitly overridden.
+4. **Spec-Level Factory Usage Refactoring (`spec/models` & `spec/requests`)**:
+   - Shared `let_it_be` records and eliminated redundant per-example fabrications across top factory-consuming specs:
+     - `spec/models`: `account_spec.rb`, `status_spec.rb`, `trends/statuses_spec.rb`, `notification_spec.rb`, `report_spec.rb`, `account/search_spec.rb`, `concerns/account/finder_concern_spec.rb`, `concerns/account/mappings_spec.rb`, `concerns/status/interaction_policy_concern_spec.rb`, `concerns/status/fasp_concern_spec.rb`, `fasp/backfill_request_spec.rb`, `announcement_spec.rb`, `follow_request_spec.rb`, `status_pin_spec.rb`, `featured_tag_spec.rb`, `severed_relationship_spec.rb`, `notification_policy_spec.rb`, and `spec/support/examples/models/concerns/ranked_trend.rb`.
+     - `spec/requests`: `api/v1/notifications_spec.rb`, `api/v2/notifications_spec.rb`, `api/v1/statuses_spec.rb`, `activitypub/replies_spec.rb`, `activitypub/contexts_spec.rb`, `api/v1/directories_spec.rb`, `api/v1/in_collections_spec.rb`, `well_known/webfinger_spec.rb`, `api/v1/profiles_spec.rb`, `statuses/embed_spec.rb`, `api/v1/statuses/contexts_spec.rb`, `activitypub/quote_authorizations_spec.rb`, `api/v1/timelines/list_spec.rb`, `unsubscriptions_spec.rb`, `severed_relationships_spec.rb`, `activitypub/featured_collections_spec.rb`, `oauth/authorizations_spec.rb`, `oauth/token_spec.rb`, `api/v1/statuses/reblogged_by_accounts_spec.rb`, `api/v1/statuses/favourited_by_accounts_spec.rb`, `api/v1/statuses/pins_spec.rb`, `api/v1/statuses/quotes_spec.rb`, and `api/v2/filters/statuses_spec.rb`.
+
+### Phase 3 Results
+- **`spec/models`**:
+  - Pre-Phase-3 runtime: ~30.9 - 32.5s (2,469 fabrications, 22.79s factory time)
+  - Post-Phase-3 runtime: **~22.0 - 22.5s** (1,582 fabrications, 13.57s factory time; 1,795 examples, 0 failures)
+  - Improvement: **~29% faster vs Phase 2** (**~40.5% reduction in factory time**, **~85% reduction vs 146.5s baseline**, **~6.6x faster overall**)
+- **`spec/requests`**:
+  - Pre-Phase-3 runtime: ~41.5 - 42.6s (2,236 fabrications, 13.15s factory time)
+  - Post-Phase-3 runtime: **~33.9 - 35.1s** (1,237 fabrications, 6.29s factory time; 1,877 examples, 0 failures)
+  - Improvement: **~18-20% faster vs Phase 2** (**~52.1% reduction in factory time**, **~77.5% reduction vs 153.8s post-Phase-1 baseline**)
+- **Combined (`spec/models` + `spec/requests`)**:
+  - Original baseline: >300 seconds (>5 minutes)
+  - Post-Phase-2 runtime: ~73.7 seconds
+  - Post-Phase-3 runtime: **~56.4 - 57.1 seconds** (**~23% faster than Phase 2**, **>5.2x faster than original baseline**)
